# HACKONEX Project

## Project Overview

I built Outage Watch as a replayable, dependency-aware monitoring system for
detecting cascading failures in a bookstore microservice platform. Run
`python solution/app.py --report` to generate the incident report, or
`python solution/app.py --serve` to open the dashboard.

The system combines robust per-service baselines, sustained trend detection,
reverse dependency traversal, daily incident analysis, and configuration-change
ranking. Together, these features identify the earliest intervention point,
the likely originating change, and the services affected by the cascade.